MODULE: RepairFrozenOriginalCapture
TARGET: FreshCaptureCoherent
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: fresh readiness copies the original revision instead of a newer admitted source tuple
PERTURBS: Capture

--- FIND
    /\ captured' = [captured EXCEPT ![v] = source[v]]
    /\ target' = [target EXCEPT ![v] = bound[v]]
    /\ first' = [first EXCEPT ![v] = source[v]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ captured' = [captured EXCEPT ![v] = 1]
    /\ target' = [target EXCEPT ![v] = bound[v]]
    /\ first' = [first EXCEPT ![v] = 1]
--- END
